      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "hey man. I've heard that you got some new gears in that old shitty PC
    you had. \nI know you prolly have tons of games to play, but you gotta try the
    MTX game. MTX Sim or sth like that.\nbro. this game. you kinda have to pay for
    lots of stuff but now kinda every game does it so...\nit has like this game where
    you fight big ass monsters and click on them, but later you dont have to click
    and you buy like upgrades and skins. i dont wanna tell too much but its pretty
    dope.\n\nand if you ever need cash for some cosmetics I always make a good buck
    on survayys or gaymtester. takes a while to do it but the cash is good and you
    can spend it on mtx. and the apps are free so I guess its just free money."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
