  m_text: "If you have camera connectivity or image issues try the following:\n\n\u2022
    Check your internet connection\n\u2022 Update your camera drivers\n\u2022 Update
    your system \n\u2022 Upgrade your graphic drivers\n\u2022 Turn your computer
    off and on\n\nIf all of the above solutions do not work try checking if the camera
    wire is properly connected to your PC. If you do not have a camera, the Camera
    app will not work properly. Before trying using the Camera app it is advised
    to purchase a web camera from your local electronics store. The quality of the
    image depends on the camera's lens quality.\n"
