  m_text: "Hello [user]!\n\nWe are proud to welcome you to the great community of
    ' Pics! We can't wait to see what great pictures you will bring to our beautiful
    collection! \n\nSnap, upload and earn- easy as that! We hope you will enjoy the
    simplicity and the bright future ' Pics can offer you. Please feel free to upload,
    browse and share your favourite photos to our App!\n\nSo take your 4K camera
    and snap them delicious ' Pics away!"
